{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/4a3629620c189acbd62546d3df7371f3.poster.avif?t=1761287961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/4a3629620c189acbd62546d3df7371f3.webm?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/4a3629620c189acbd62546d3df7371f3.mp4?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHi is a 3D puzzle platformer that takes you on an emotional journey through 6 levels, each representing a key life experience. Solve puzzles, explore, and immerse yourself in stunning visuals and a powerful story.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/baac422ddc9711182af7679b0959aa9c.avif?t=1761287961\" width=650 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are lost, with no guide and no clear path ahead. Every step forward is yours to discover,\u00a0every secret corner yours to unveil. The world won\u2019t tell you where to go \u2014 you must find the\u00a0way on your own<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/43151cd6f5e95a1a5e56381ee57807a7.poster.avif?t=1761287961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/43151cd6f5e95a1a5e56381ee57807a7.webm?t=1761287961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600240/extras/43151cd6f5e95a1a5e56381ee57807a7.mp4?t=1